<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Putco half yr share drops, div down.</title>
<headline>Putco half yr share drops, div down.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     13.9     vs    18.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  7.0     vs     8.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    3.66    vs     4.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    6.70    vs     8.18</p>
<p>    Tax			  2.75    vs     3.19</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    0.17    vs     --</p>
<p>    Interest received	1.21    vs     3.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		 307.83    vs   291.48</p>
<p>Div payable: April 18</p>
<p>On register: April 4</p>
<p>Full name: Putco Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that should operating conditions remain reasonably stable, the present level of profitability could be improved.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
